        "media_position": "right",
        "media_width": "11",
        "subheading": "<p>Laboratory Grown Diamond</p>",
        "title": "<p><strong>What is a Laboratory Grown Diamond?</strong></p>",
        "description": "<p>Laboratory grown diamonds are diamonds created using advanced technology that replicates the natural conditions in which mined diamonds form beneath the earth.</p><p>From a <strong>chemical, physical and optical perspective, they are identical to diamonds</strong>, with any differences imperceptible to the human eye. Mined and laboratory grown diamonds can only be identified by using specialised equipment.<br/><br/><br/><br/></p>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
        "button_1_text": "",
        "button_1_link": "",
        "button_style": "underline"
      }
    },
