        "content_position": "topLeftSticky",
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "<p><strong>Our Perspective</strong></p>",
        "description": "<p>We believe laboratory grown diamonds offer a considered alternative within the diamond landscape.</p><p>We work with our clients to discuss the different aspects of both laboratory grown and mined diamonds. Rather than preferring one option as superior, we are committed to <strong>providing clear, unbiased education,</strong> empowering you to choose what feels most aligned with your values, priorities and story.</p>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
        "button_1_text": "",
        "button_1_link": "#",
        "button_style": "underline"
      }
    },
    "text_with_media_HfpXNt": {
