            "title": "<p><strong>Ethical Considerations</strong></p>",
            "description": "<p>Reliable, published data around the social impact of laboratory grown diamonds is still developing.</p><p>Areas of uncertainty include:</p><ul><li>Employment conditions in manufacturing facilities</li><li>Human rights standards across production regions</li><li>Contributions to local communities and economies<br/></li></ul><p>Unlike some mined diamond industries, laboratory grown production does not always have established frameworks for community investment or traceable impact.</p>",
            "description_mobile": "<p>Reliable, published data around the social impact of laboratory grown diamonds is still developing.</p><p>Areas of uncertainty include:</p><ul><li>Employment conditions in manufacturing facilities</li><li>Human rights standards across production regions</li><li>Contributions to local communities and economies<br/></li></ul><p>Unlike some mined diamond industries, laboratory grown production does not always have established frameworks for community investment or traceable impact.</p>",
