            "subheading": "",
            "title": "<p><strong>Traceability & Transparencya</strong></p>",
            "description": "<p>Traceability remains one of the most complex aspects of both laboratory grown and natural diamonds.<br/><br/>Once laboratory grown diamonds enter the global market, identifying their exact origin and production conditions becomes challenging.<br/><br/>At Natalie Marie Jewellery, we apply the same due diligence standards to laboratory grown diamonds as we do to natural diamonds, working only with suppliers who meet our strict requirements.<br/></p>",
