            "title": "<p><strong>Certification & Quality</strong></p>",
            "description": "<p>All of our laboratory grown diamonds above 0.30ct are independently certified by leading gemological institutes, including:<br/></p><ul><li><strong>GIA (Gemological Institute of America)</strong></li><li><strong>IGI (International Gemological Institute)</strong></li><li><strong>GCAL (Gem Certification & Assurance Lab)</strong><br/></li></ul><p>Each stone features:<br/></p><ul><li>A unique certification number</li><li>Detailed grading across cut, colour, clarity and carat<br/></li></ul>",
